     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The loop finds the first five numbers that are divisible by <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code> or <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">3</code>. These numbers are <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">3</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">4</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">6</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">8</code>, and thus <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">8</code> is the final <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i</code>'s value."
